---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProjectFeature from '../components/ProjectFeature.astro';
import { profile, mileage } from '../data/portfolio';
---
<Layout title="박규태 | 수학, 통계, 그리고 구현" description={profile.description}>
  <section class="portfolio-intro">
    <div class="hero-copy hero-reveal">
      <p class="hero-kicker"><span></span> Mathematics · Modeling · Computation</p>
      <h1>구조를 이해하고,<br /><em>질문을 모델로.</em></h1>
      <p class="intro-description">연세대학교 수학과에서 대수학과 정수론을 공부합니다. 현실의 문제를 수학으로 표현하고, 데이터와 코드로 가정을 확인합니다.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button-primary" href="/projects/">프로젝트 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/about/">소개 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="home-portrait hero-reveal hero-reveal-delay" href="/about/" aria-label="박규태 소개 보기">
      <img src="/avatar.webp" alt="박규태" width="540" height="660" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
      <span>수학을 공부하고, 질문을 구현합니다. <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span>
    </a>
  </section>
  <section class="home-focus" aria-label="관심 분야">
    <p class="home-focus-label">Current interests</p>
    <ul><li>Algebra & Number Theory</li><li>Probability & Optimization</li><li>Graph Machine Learning <span>Exploring</span></li></ul>
  </section>
  <section class="portfolio-section" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
    <div class="section-heading numbered-heading"><span class="section-number">01</span><div><p>Selected work</p><h2 id="projects-heading">생각을 도구로</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">모든 프로젝트 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <ProjectFeature />
  </section>
  <section class="portfolio-section" aria-labelledby="writing-heading">
    <div class="section-heading numbered-heading"><span class="section-number">02</span><div><p>Field notes</p><h2 id="writing-heading">과정과 생각</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">모든 글 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <a class="writing-preview" href={mileage.article}>
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Yonsei Mileage · 개발과 검증</p><h3>예측은 정확해졌는데, 왜 배분은 나빠졌을까?</h3><p>수강신청 문제에서 출발해 확률 모델과 최적화를 실제 결과로 검토한 기록.</p></div>
      <span class="writing-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
